    answer: 'It\'s a free online utility that converts video frames to images (JPG, PNG, etc.) directly in your browser, requiring no uploads or registration.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How do I convert a video to JPG images?',
    answer: 'Upload your video, choose JPG as output format, select extraction mode (manual, interval, or scene detection), then download the frames.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How do I convert a video to an image sequence?',
    answer: 'Use interval extraction or scene detection to capture frames in order, then download them as a numbered ZIP sequence.'
