    question: 'How many frames can I extract at once?',
    answer: 'There is no hard limit, but extracting thousands of frames may consume significant browser memory. For very long videos, we recommend using Smart Scene Detection or larger intervals.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Does this work on mobile devices?',
